The Anthropic OAuth request-shaping behavior in this project (billing-header
attestation, beta flag sets, Claude Code identity headers, system-prompt
relocation, prompt-cache layout, credential refresh flow) is reimplemented
for interoperability, informed by the MIT-licensed opencode-claude-auth
project (griffinmartin/opencode-claude-auth and the YanzuoLu fork). No source
code was copied verbatim; the implementation here is original.
